{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"14歲女童馬鞍山失蹤　最後露面身穿白恤衫和藍短裙\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/MISSING-KID-261113-13.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】一名14歲女童在馬鞍山失蹤。</p><p>失蹤的女童蕭樂瑤，據報她周三離開馬鞍山耀安邨的住所後便失蹤。她身高約一點五米，體重約40公斤，瘦身材及長黑髮。她最後露面時身穿白色恤衫和藍色短裙，攜有一個黑色背包。</p><p>警方呼籲，任何人如有該名失蹤女童的消息，可致電新界南總區失蹤人口調查組(36611173)。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T06:57:31.349442+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":152,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T06:17:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T23:02:33.147398+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T06:51:02.626138+00:00","content_hash":"0d08bb1fd0e777f045a7d7b01379b1b26d782dbed9f7ead181c72e240e2d6625","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-13T06:57:31.349442+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}